$$\begin{aligned} & \text { Circle }(x-a)^2+(y-a)^2=a^2 \\\\ & x^2+y^2-2 a x-2 a y+a^2=0 \\\\ & \text { intercept }=2 \\\\ & \Rightarrow 2 \sqrt{a^2-d^2}=2 \end{aligned}$$ 

